sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Domain command
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Dispatcher as Outbox dispatcher
    participant Redis as BullMQ on Redis
    participant Consumer as Worker consumer
    participant External as External provider
    rect rgb(235, 247, 240)
        API->>DB: BEGIN
        API->>DB: Domain rows and outbox event
        API->>DB: COMMIT
    end
    Dispatcher->>DB: Lease due outbox rows
    DB-->>Dispatcher: Event IDs and minimal payloads
    Dispatcher->>Redis: Enqueue event ID
    Dispatcher->>DB: Record dispatch attempt
    Note over Dispatcher,Redis: Crash can duplicate enqueue, SQL remains recoverable
    Redis->>Consumer: Deliver job at least once
    Consumer->>DB: Claim consumer/event receipt and task lease
    alt Already completed
        Consumer-->>Redis: Acknowledge no-op
    else SQL-only effect
        Consumer->>DB: Effect plus completed receipt in one transaction
    else External effect
        Consumer->>External: Stable operation key
        External-->>Consumer: Known result or unknown timeout
        Consumer->>DB: Persist result or reconciliation task
        Consumer->>DB: Complete receipt only after durable resolution
    end
    Note over Consumer,External: No general exactly-once guarantee for external effects
